      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a8cfad150f18029131e364faa705099aaf523389dc87a47569ddbdb3c32faba",
      "text": "Handoffs",
      "hash": "29f217d5d86062d687fceaed0f8ff7da2900d2b2b33d409e4abfd6ebe310c1b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "69e997eb333d466e22dfa3afb61b7819419c6fe4e3e42084f569247cdaaab5ba",
      "text": "Ticket",
      "hash": "567a8b5f8f5ce3c525286711a68555da645ab87e929439f5badba2507fd2b6eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "482decfd9fdb842d1aec9d157bb24efb6cdf9e356e1d496cbc0229e989a6609d",
      "text": "A handoff artifact scoping one session of work. Stands alone or hangs off a spec. Can block or be blocked by sibling tickets.",
      "hash": "35ab4eeb0c2fd19ab2289363a0755fd15f77a617b78260f67c9ace79c810242b"
    },
    {
      "id": "681830cdd601ce3f7a1b773ce6b9b6fce1bc574203a1ae943e3638f6cb888a76",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "4d1c02b4f8b8954c24b627eb31f8053625ccc64f54afcb5a242143f617c4257d",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e0a39722fb8d74d42f97f95effbb4d411093bd99743dbfe3715cf10559ea662",
      "text": "handoff artifact",
      "hash": "741619a26b388b5e1035994e6e7ce6c59c885ebd231ad21f8d9ff02438a0cbc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "165a1ff16ce3339f82a81625f78eaa22f87a86b80c7b40b0f02b432dc212b401",
      "text": "scoping one",
      "hash": "32825fb3c2999a5b99535b38a0e8378bb2ca01115884c423aa61506e26ee0a1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "385ce5a9439b632463b65c0ebda42adbb68c453a13aa09bb0ddd69434c8dedfb",
      "text": "of work. Stands alone, or hangs off a",
      "hash": "3bfcc86f8e6b8221e2a83e0f9312f2190bcdbeb5be8d72f785bb3b754b9432f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "f63390876522bb6443153fe254a198d7e9b970223bbb3015f3d3af003ecaba90",
      "text": "as one of its children. Tickets can block or be blocked by sibling tickets, so the order of work falls out of their dependency graph rather than a linear plan.",
      "hash": "d5bc37a6d916369cebf5c5b1ba99029a0080ca85d0d5921495833c168bdd4ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "f90d353d5f6cc4c5a83111e48d926347ac4c4a4ad9b8455d12fc8731b5a43ee8",
      "text": "The defining constraint is the size: one session. A ticket should be completable before the session drifts out of the",
      "hash": "960804db1100459f05c0428a970d2ef3271b7b3d0fe327c93c2800bcd2bcf87d"
    },
    {
      "id": "43e8f33b336af4946afde0c5d4a4b7ad27dbf0f004f85090cecda8c3e5c1b29f",
      "text": "smart zone",
      "hash": "bb3f6aa92ec029f636da2bd637e41c9e6c26586e54527ede34151e0cf892cdb8"
    },
    {
      "id": "3200093d40314acdf943b3d9457f73ddb2f22dc641a3a793e130d5d0276c2b54",
      "text": "— and that constraint is testable. If sessions on your tickets routinely degrade before the work is done, the tickets are too big; split them. If each session spends most of its",
      "hash": "0cd1d6f003f38594dd7110bf5beaf620ddbd67f178385bdf2d054cb44f2a19f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "da392186fdd04e00056d5335a0d46b5af083ce80e72954c2e4a0b4c737dc53af",
      "text": "on setup before doing five minutes of work, they're too small; merge them.",
      "hash": "7b57f77211bc4a1f99ffca2f66f7a4a44eb0c12299d754ae0b0ac5b9c2578649"
    },
    {
      "id": "045e58563c6d0d531d02261d700065e49baeccfd442d82ad30b42dd7b5a50506",
      "text": "A good ticket is written for a reader with no other context. The goal, the acceptance criteria, and",
      "hash": "2a23aadf218f19fddc7215fc0e173b26cb1830f3f9ed03e72895b9370ccf565a"
    },
    {
      "id": "1650d8bc78c7acf5b8df1615bed03912155f090b065cfdacd579208018d06f6f",
      "text": "context pointers",
      "hash": "82528bbf7c9c348f2db59980c707a48c7c85c4ea3d7f7f63f107a209445930c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "7171058c91da58286e4dea285cd1e3eda24ae20216d5da71f74b86638be8763c",
      "text": "to the relevant files and decisions — enough that the session can start working without re-deriving what the last one knew.",
      "hash": "718426b0095d12e6c7e89a301a332953e797dd2233443eb325e9d27b42dff370"
    },
    {
      "id": "39284a1c24927256084dd6c63a6d6ec7e7d54e35198689f2f1b32c9baa56b97b",
      "text": "The dependency graph is also what unlocks parallelism. Independent tickets — the leaves of the graph — can each run in their own session at the same time. This is an effective way of running multiple agents at once.",
      "hash": "4a3dd9a01299169bd9306f92f5b620439a074ae0fb0c0c7cd76d02832e6d88e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "675b80aeebfdbc421cfc291d3179f8f2517a70e6b8d273c19fea51c2d170a8fe",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "15da6edfca5a9f718650897122ee1078283c988e16bdccb2a4873d9abc616ff3",
      "text": "\"Where do I start on the migration spec?\"",
      "hash": "f2da95ad2f27da311e8e1ff5278c8165da231e091c6abdb4ff1c50b83a0290ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "64faa5c9b437af4754d6f4262b7aec0b9f3ab15a8f145702ac962834f6668d18",
      "text": "\"Look at the ticket graph — the schema change blocks the backfill, the backfill blocks the API switch. Pick a leaf and run a session on it.\"",
      "hash": "e943c6820ec85699eaf100bc73bc872d5ade879065db46ce11e7bfc9f4f82bf1"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c698693ba7307e1d74419c5a488dcf70ad71c6b9b098a3ac3a9098e14b257ed",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fd45ae92e00a42ecede6f97eaa8d1e46a273cb3c135adb4ed7e68b2cbbbc2ca",
      "text": "Spec",
      "hash": "9bdc1337d7016d5825e164ca3a90ad5cb013b39396a1a1ee6324f8dc5ed6a1ee"
    },
    {
